nts: Failed to start fs event stream.\n2026-10-01 18:54:06.482 xcodebuild[13681:36875716] [MT] DVTDeveloperPaths: Failed to get length of DARWIN_USER_CACHE_DIR from confstr(3), error = Error Domain=NSPOSIXErrorDomain Code=5 \"Input/output error\". Using NSCachesDirectory instead.\ngit: warning: confstr() failed with code 5: couldn't get path of DARWIN_USER_TEMP_DIR; using /tmp instead\ngit: error: couldn't create cache file '/tmp/xcrun_db-XidCs6q1' (errno=Operation not permitted)\n2026-10-01 18:54:07.637 xcodebuild[13688:36875767]  DVTFilePathFSEvents: Failed to start fs event stream.\n2026-10-01 18:54:08.424 xcodebuild[13688:36875764] [MT] DVTDeveloperPaths: Failed to get length of DARWIN_USER_CACHE_DIR from confstr(3), error = Error Domain=NSPOSIXErrorDomain Code=5 \"Input/output error\". Using NSCachesDirectory instead.\ne5b856b9 feat(yin.repl): publish modules by signed name from indexed code, with rows every round and names folded from loaded snapshots — linker over DHT slice L4\nbd9bfae7 feat(yin.repl): require loads modules from the DHT, parks, and completes on the load's own event — linker over DHT slice L3\n79c1e55d feat(yin.vm.linker): module closure walker and plain-Clojure load and link over the DHT by address — linker over DHT slice L2\na5e47c8d Merge branch 'linker-l1' into linker-l2\ne5392305 feat(yin.vm.linker): module publisher with footprint, Ed25519 name signing, stable key files and a shared local runtime — linker over DHT slice L0\n3c76c063 feat(dao.space.dht): staged load over any walk, bounded fresh and repair queues, and publication results — linker over DHT slice L1\na1f41db3 docs(design): linker over dao.jing.dht — load and evaluate code from the DHT by signed name\ngit: warning: confstr() failed with code 5: couldn't get path of DARWIN_USER_TEMP_DIR; using /tmp instead\ngit: error: couldn't create cache file '/tmp/xcrun_db-ysZD8i4j' (errno=Operation not permitted)\n2026-10-01 18:54:10.664 xcodebuild[13701:36875852]  DVTFilePathFSEvents: Failed to start fs event stream.\n2026-10-01 18:54:11.270 xcodebuild[13701:36875851] [MT] DVTDeveloperPaths: Failed to get length of DARWIN_USER_CACHE_DIR from confstr(3), error = Error Domain=NSPOSIXErrorDomain Code=5 \"Input/output error\". Using NSCachesDirectory instead.\ngit: warning: confstr() failed with code 5: couldn't get path of DARWIN_USER_TEMP_DIR; using /tmp instead\ngit: error: couldn't create cache file '/tmp/xcrun_db-gfVsphq6' (errno=Operation not permitted)\n2026-10-01 18:54:12.336 xcodebuild[13707:36875933]  DVTFilePathFSEvents: Failed to start fs event stream.\n2026-10-01 18:54:12.929 xcodebuild[13707:36875932] [MT] DVTDeveloperPaths: Failed to get length of DARWIN_USER_CACHE_DIR from confstr(3), error = Error Domain=NSPOSIXErrorDomain Code=5 \"Input/output error\". Using NSCachesDirectory instead.\n docs/agents/build-n-test.md             |   24 +-\n docs/design/dao.jing.dht.md             |   46 +-\n docs/design/yin.repl.dao.space-index.md |   21 +\n docs/design/yin.repl.link-policy.md     |    8 +\n docs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md        | 1555 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n docs/design/yin.vm.linker.md            |   10 +\n pubspec.lock                            |   24 +\n pubspec.yaml                            |    1 +\n src/cljc/dao/space/dht.cljc             | 1072 +++++++++++++++++----\n src/cljc/yin/repl.cljc                  |  118 ++-\n src/cljc/yin/repl/dht.cljc              |   92 +-\n src/cljc/yin/repl/index.cljc            |  100 +-\n src/cljc/yin/repl/link.cljc             |  175 +++-\n src/cljc/yin/repl/main.cljc             |  195 +++-\n src/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc            |  224 ++++-\n src/cljc/yin/vm/linker.cljc             |   36 +\n src/cljc/yin/vm/linker/closure.cljc     |  275 ++++++\n src/cljc/yin/vm/linker/dht.cljc         |  344 +++++++\n src/cljc/yin/vm/linker/publish.cljc     |  454 +++++++++\n src/cljc/yin/vm/linker/sign.cljc        |  227 +++++\n test/dao/space/dht_test.cljc            | 1228 ++++++++++++++